---
description: Words and status styling for anything a guest sees on the lift board
alwaysApply: true
---

Guests call them **runs**, never "trails." Use "run" in every heading, label, and message a guest can read.
Code can keep the word `trail` (types, variables, `getTrails()`); only the visible text changes.

Every lift or run status renders with `<StatusBadge status={...} />`. Never hand-style a status span.

Do:    <h2>Open Runs</h2> ... <StatusBadge status={run.status} />
Don't: <h2>Open Trails</h2> ... <span style={{ color: "green" }}>{trail.status}</span>

See @components/StatusBadge.tsx.
